":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":247,"player":3,"text":"Two queens should not have been possible. Two queens were possible. All is the Hive and the Hive are all, and if they were capable of joy, they would be reasonably pleased about this. Not excessively. It is, after all, only the one world.","kind":"info"},{"turn":247,"player":3,"text":"Now buildable: The Molting Chamber, The Second Feeding, The Second Queen's Shell.","kind":"good"},{"turn":247,"player":3,"text":"Research begins: There Were Always This Many.","kind":"research"},{"turn":247,"player":0,"text":"The Hive As It Stands has begun growing a second Queen. Two lesser works come first, and the Shell will stand in a Hive holding one of them. They do not appear to think this is unusual.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":247,"player":1,"text":"The Hive As It Stands has begun growing a second Queen. Two lesser works come first, and the Shell will stand in a Hive holding one of them. They do not appear to think this is unusual.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":247,"player":3,"text":"Work has begun towards a second Queen. Nobody in the Hive has remarked on it. Two works in any Hive, then the Shell itself in a Hive holding one of them.","kind":"good","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":247,"player":4,"text":"The Hive As It Stands has begun growing a second Queen. Two lesser works come first, and the Shell will stand in a Hive holding one of them. They do not appear to think this is unusual.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":247,"player":5,"text":"The Hive As It Stands has begun growing a second Queen. Two lesser works come first, and the Shell will stand in a Hive holding one of them. They do not appear to think this is unusual.","kind":"bad","cue":"ending","at":[34,8]},{"turn":248,"player":0,"text":"Peon finishes a road.","kind":"good","at":[47,39]},{"turn":248,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":248,"player":0,"tex